# Sandstone pillar (items.md Decorations): a papyrus-bundle column with
# an open lotus capital: green sepals on the bell, lapis and green
# binding bands, a square abacus on top, a round base drum. 0.5 x 1.0 u.
# Shaded as a cylinder lit from the top-left: brightest a third in from
# the left, the right edge in shade. Solid.
